note pajdun: why the loaded bundle-backed item with a base has no diff, asked without making one: 0
note it has or can have one (the cache file is there; or neither file is and the project's git store
note holds the base commit, or git did not run), 3 the store does not hold the base commit (pabcat,
note the check pabdiff makes), 4 the marker says its diff was cut at 16 MiB
fn pajdun to ulong
w = pabst
if eq w 0
ret 0
end
if eq w 2
ret 4
end
if pabbcap
ret 5
end
if pabbad
ret 6
end
r = pabcat
if lt r 0
pabbset
ret 6
end
if gt r 0
ret 3
end
ret 0
end
note pajduw u: diff_unavailable: null when diff is a link (0), else the reason
fn pajduw u ulong to void
if eq u 1
